["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1351: Ancient Viral Sword and Shield VIPER RAMP EVO2 triplex R-loop P-tau CRISPR interference\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-twiv-crispr的祖先不切割dna-而是靠蛮力缠住双链让基因沉默/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>CRISPR的祖先不切割DNA，而是靠蛮力缠住双链让基因沉默</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Doudna实验室不是测出新序列，而是用AlphaFold做结构比对，在噬菌体里翻出了比CRISPR更古老、只用一个蛋白靠错位配对让基因沉默的系统VIPER。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRISPR</span><span class=\"tag\">基因编辑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Gospels: Are They Historical? Synoptic Gospels Q source New Testament Apocrypha\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-ancients-福音书不是目击证词-而是精心塑造的希腊罗马式传记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00f48c8e9249c767-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>福音书不是目击证词，而是精心塑造的希腊罗马式传记</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现存最早的福音书写于耶稣死后约40年，马太、路加大段照抄马可原文却各自增删；作者真正想回答的不是历史上发生了什么，而是这个人为何能是基督。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福音书</span><span class=\"tag\">历史耶稣</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 253 - Kangaroos marching molars pentapedal locomotion carnassials macropod\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-thecommondesce-有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不动-只能像哥斯拉一样行走/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不动，只能像哥斯拉一样行走</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">化石显示部分巨型袋鼠体重可达270公斤，骨骼证据显示它们很可能跳不动，一串更新世足迹轨迹最终证实至少有一种是靠双脚走路的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物演化</span><span class=\"tag\">澳大利亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"94. What to Do When Everything Looks Like a Catastrophe? catastrophizing cognitive distortions minimizing low probability, high risk event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-nostupid-母亲在海里没了脉搏-她才明白灾难化和真灾难的区别/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">31:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>母亲在海里没了脉搏，她才明白灾难化和真灾难的区别</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判断是不是灾难化，不看焦虑强度本身，而看它配不配得上眼前的真实处境——真在海里溺水那几分钟，五分的恐慌才是恰如其分的反应。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灾难化思维</span><span class=\"tag\">认知行为疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"399. Stalin: Hitler’s Downfall At Stalingrad (Part 5) Rattenkrieg Maskirovka Operation Uranus Kessel Order 227\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-empirehist-希特勒因斯大林格勒这个名字-把整支军团送进了包围圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">51:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>希特勒因斯大林格勒这个名字，把整支军团送进了包围圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">斯大林格勒本不是德军的目标，只是通往高加索油田路上顺手拿下的地标；久攻不下后，它变成了对斯大林本人的象征性复仇，而苏联趁德军深陷巷战时完成了「天王星」合围。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯大林格勒战役</span><span class=\"tag\">二战东线</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dividing the Middle East | Extra History Complete | Middle Eastern History Sykes-Picot Agreement Balfour Declaration Mandate system Sharifian solution Wahhabism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-extracredits-两位外交官用地名首字母画出了中东的国界线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6de6b278809ad001-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>两位外交官用地名首字母画出了中东的国界线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国一边和法国秘密画线瓜分中东，一边向阿拉伯起义领袖承诺独立建国，两份密约互相拆台，成了今天边界争端的源头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东历史</span><span class=\"tag\">奥斯曼帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robot-Use Agents: Why General-Purpose Models May Win in Robotics VLA (Vision-Language-Action Model) end-effector pose code as policies in-context learning (ICL) platonic representation hypothesis bitter lesson\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-ycsp-机器人学会用手-靠的不是机器人数据-而是电脑操作数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d349e6f062ef50c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>机器人学会用手，靠的不是机器人数据，而是电脑操作数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用大模型正在把编程、操作电脑、认识空间的能力打包迁移到机器人身上，业内预计两年内就会出现能听懂任何指令、干活像称职青少年的通用机器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人控制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Nuclear Close Calls DEFCON Foxtrot-class submarine sounding rocket nuclear briefcase\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-stuffmissed-核鱼雷发射需全体军官一致同意-一人反对救了世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>核鱼雷发射需全体军官一致同意，一人反对救了世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四艘驶向古巴的苏联核潜艇里，旗舰B-59规定核鱼雷发射需三名军官全票同意——舰队指挥官阿尔希波夫的反对票，让1962年那次成为离核战最近的一刻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">核武器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Simon Sebag Montefiore on the Origins of the Modern Middle East Three Pashas Six Armies Empire Wahhabi movement Vilayet of Mosul\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-goodfight-美国打伊拉克战争-意外把伊朗扶成了中东最强帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>美国打伊拉克战争，意外把伊朗扶成了中东最强帝国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊拉克战争暴露了美国不敢打持久战、经不起伤亡的弱点，伊朗借机把伊拉克民兵、叙利亚、黎巴嫩、胡塞和哈马斯连成「六军帝国」，成了萨珊王朝以来最强的伊朗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东</span><span class=\"tag\">奥斯曼帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Aaron Levie, Steven Sinofsky &amp; Martin Casado: How Do You Secure a World of AI Agents? pacing X-risk FINRA tempest attack covert channel\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-a16z-喊出物种灭绝风险却只肯放慢发布节奏-这套说辞两头不讨好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>喊出物种灭绝风险却只肯放慢发布节奏，这套说辞两头不讨好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果真信AI有灭绝级风险，唯一自洽的应对是国有化管控，而不是自愿放慢发布节奏——现在这套说法让监管者和行业都不满意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"898: An Argument HBCU PWI (Predominantly White Institution)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-tal-她为教育平等把女儿送进薄弱学校-翻旧邮件后却向女儿道了歉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a15149eee287a5ec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>她为教育平等把女儿送进薄弱学校，翻旧邮件后却向女儿道了歉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十年前她的文章说服无数家长相信融合教育，十年后翻出自己求助学校未果的旧邮件，她才第一次向女儿承认自己错了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育公平</span><span class=\"tag\">种族融合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenRouter: from Seed to Stripe — with OpenRouter’s Alex Atallah &amp; AMP’s Anjney Midha BYOK auto router Mixture of Models (MoM) wrapper OpenClaw\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-latentspace-模型训练不难-难的是送到开发者手上-顶级实验室常年做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/debf89b08ca0ef78-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>模型训练不难，难的是送到开发者手上——顶级实验室常年做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic花了一年多才让Claude触达开发者，OpenRouter却能在新模型发布当天送去100万开发者——分发，才是模型实验室最大的短板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型路由</span><span class=\"tag\">开发者分发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Investing In The Great Wealth Transfer: Masters in Business with Adam Frank QSBS inter vivos NIL 10b5-1 plan direct indexing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-mastersinbiz-跑赢指数半个点没人在意-省下十万美元的税却让客户记你一辈子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>跑赢指数半个点没人在意，省下十万美元的税却让客户记你一辈子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客户对跑赢或跑输基准零点五个百分点几乎无感，但如果你能帮他省下十万美元的税，他就会认定你是不可替代的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">遗产规划</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Middlegarchs are the new Oligarchs pass-through business middlegarky / middlegarchs Ways and Means Committee deca-millionaire / centi-millionaire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-planetmoney-美国真正有权力的不是亿万富豪-是三百万个隐形富人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">30:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>美国真正有权力的不是亿万富豪，是三百万个隐形富人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三百万名穿透式企业主合计持有的财富是福布斯400强的13倍以上，还占据国会税法委员会四分之一的席位，真正决定税制和市场规则的是他们。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">税制改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Zero to One in AI Safety: Halcyon&#x27;s Mike McCormick on Launching 30 New Orgs &amp; the Founder Bottleneck AI 2027 Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) Self-Other Overlap GRAM (Gradient-Routed Auxiliary Modules) Independent Verification Organizations (IVO) zero knowledge proofs for inference verification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-cogrev-ai安全领域最缺的不是资金-而是会建组织的创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b147a0ec6a4652db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全领域最缺的不是资金，而是会建组织的创始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Halcyon三年孵化出30家机构、带动约5亿美元资金，创始人的组织能力才是把宏大而模糊的安全构想变成真正机构的稀缺资源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">创业孵化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Potemkin Pacific, Midterm Budget Woes work at risk FME (foreign material exploitation) CCA (collaborative combat aircraft) combined minds hellscape\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-chinatalk-太平洋司令的舰队全在中东-不战而胜是因为他没兵可战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7341616991c2db6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>太平洋司令的舰队全在中东：不战而胜是因为他没兵可战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Paparo 上了时代周刊封面，说法是他的部队覆盖半个地球、必须不战而胜；同一周 40% 的在航海军压在中东，印太司令部刚改名叫太平洋司令部，而它的船全在印度洋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防预算</span><span class=\"tag\">无人系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Grass Apes silicate (phytolith) Poaceae Homopoaceae\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-radiolab-小麦水稻和直立行走-可能都是被禾草-驯化-的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23580c7e7c6b632c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">22:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Radiolab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>小麦水稻和直立行走，可能都是被禾草「驯化」的结果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">生物学家David Haskell认为，禾草是人类演化的「共同缔造者」——不仅决定了我们吃什么，还可能是我们站起来用两条腿走路的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人类演化</span><span class=\"tag\">植物学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Busses and Overpasses parkway Muzak\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-stuffmissed-摩西压低立交桥挡黑人的证据-只来自一个死无对证的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">22:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>摩西压低立交桥挡黑人的证据，只来自一个死无对证的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这个说法出自摩西助手 Sidney Shapiro 对 Caro 的讲述，但 Shapiro 在书出版前两年就去世了，而且部分被指控的桥梁其实是照搬 Westchester 已有桥梁尺寸建的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">城市规划</span><span class=\"tag\">种族主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Raising Capable Friends, Not Just Capable Kids, Sissy Goff and David Thomas on Navigating Friendship Season FAIL (First Attempt In Learning) back pocket questions balcony friends / basement friends charismatic characters pace setters\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-raisinggh-别教孩子怎么交朋友-教他们怎么当一个好朋友/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98a9c15570a9f337-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">47:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>别教孩子怎么交朋友，教他们怎么当一个好朋友</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理咨询师发现，孩子社交焦虑的解药不是教他们讨好谁，而是引导他们把注意力从「我」转向对方，主动去当一个好朋友。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">儿童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">社交焦虑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Hollywood Was Cooked Before AI, and Now It&#x27;s Only Getting Worse below the line mini room WGA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-oddlots-好莱坞拍摄日十年腰斩-真凶是税收补贴而非ai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>好莱坞拍摄日十年腰斩，真凶是税收补贴而非AI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">洛杉矶实拍量从2016年约四万个拍摄日跌到不足两万，推手是剧组为省税逃去南卡、温哥华、都柏林，AI目前真正咬住的是灯光化妆等幕后岗位，还没轮到编剧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">好莱坞</span><span class=\"tag\">编剧工会</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Stranded? Who pays when air travel breaks waterfall misconnect controllable cause geste commercial loss ratio dangerous professional\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-complexsys-航司说延误不是他们的错-但退款规则不看原因/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c49b406f17d6733-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>航司说延误不是他们的错，但退款规则不看原因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国民航自动退款新规原因盲：只要航班取消或出现重大变更，不论是天气、空管故障还是航司自己的问题，都必须原路退款，航司说「不是我们的错」不影响这项权利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者权益</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"When Muhammad Ali Met Henry’s Hammer short win / long win Bodyline Series smelling salts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-cautionary-阿里被库珀的左勾拳打醒-才成了阿里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>阿里被库珀的左勾拳打醒，才成了阿里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1963年那场雨战里，库珀的「亨利之锤」把克莱打懵，也打掉了他靠嘴赢的幻觉——他后来拒绝戴回道具王冠，改口称库珀是真正的斗士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">竞争伦理</span><span class=\"tag\">长赢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Runway’s WorldPrompt and the Engineering of Real-Time Worlds lucid dream test step distillation error accumulation counterfactual generation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-latentspace-runway-赌上-1000-张-a100-世界模型绕开数字孪生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdf22c0e643321fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>Runway 赌上 1000 张 A100：世界模型绕开数字孪生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Runway 在 Series B 阶段就签下 1000 张 A100 集群，赌视频 scaling law 成立；如今世界模型只需一张环境照片就能 rollout 策略，绕开了为每个任务建数字孪生的老路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">视频生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"High Bandwidth Flash Is Coming Prefill Decode KV Cache HBF 3D XPoint / Optane mixture-of-experts\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-24-asianometry-hbm-堆得越高越慢-闪存堆叠要来抢它的位置/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b7c07e51ca86497-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>HBM 堆得越高越慢，闪存堆叠要来抢它的位置</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">HBM 每加一层容量，单位带宽就被稀释一次；Sandisk 把 NAND 用同样的方式堆起来做 HBF，容量是 HBM4 的 8-16 倍，但读写慢两个数量级，且要重演 Optane 的软件难题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 推理</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>"]